# The specification text the corpus's `spec:ecma402@...` provenance names (corpus revision 27, milestone SJL-9.2,
# work package SJL-9.2a).
#
# Every `spec:ecma402@3d4c558#<clause-id>` entry is a clause of ECMA-402 as tc39/ecma402 holds it at the revision below:
# the last commit of its main branch on or before 2026-05-08, the commit date of test262 ccaac100, which both
# engines' rules pin (Broiler.VM's JSD-0082, decision D14 as revised on 2026-10-26). Its next commit on main,
# b3c5c251, is of 2026-05-11. The text already holds the Intl Locale Info proposal, merged into it as 70b0ecc
# ("Normative: Intl Locale info (#942)", 2026-02-19), so the corpus pins no separate copy of that proposal. The
# vectors cite a clause by its id in the text's `emu-clause` elements, as the corpus cites ECMA-262's.
#
# THE RENDERED SPECIFICATION. The repository's own deployment of this commit, the commit dbf7726a of its gh-pages
# branch ("Deploying to gh-pages from @ tc39/ecma402@3d4c558..."), holds the text ecmarkup rendered from it, as
# `index.html`; `document`, `bytes` and `sha256` below are that file's. The `file` lines are the sources it was
# rendered from, `spec/*.html` at the revision, each by its length and SHA-256, the files the correspondence of
# bundle sjl-9-001 read (Broiler.VM's docs/evidence/sjl-9-001/correspondence.md, section "References").
#
# THE TEXTS ADDED TO IT (decision D14). Both engines also follow, for operations the revision does not contain:
# - the Intl era and month code proposal at its last commit on or before 2026-05-08, which is 5833eae (2026-03-19):
#   on 2026-10-26 its main branch still ended there. Its clauses are cited as `proposal:intl-era-monthcode@5833eae`
#   and its text is pinned by sources/intl-era-monthcode.pin;
# - Intl over Temporal, by tc39/proposal-temporal@e8cc03fc's spec/intl.html (Broiler.VM's JSD-0078, decision D1),
#   which carries 377fb80e and replaces some steps of this revision's DateTimeFormat clauses. Its clauses are cited
#   as `proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc` and its text is pinned by sources/temporal.pin.
#
# The corpus archives none of these files and quotes no text of them. They were read on 2026-10-26 from a blobless
# clone of tc39/ecma402; each can be verified:
#
#   git -C <ecma402> show 3d4c558180f643d7dea75f011a6355fb285f377e:spec/intl.html | sha256sum
#   git -C <ecma402> show dbf7726a948333972707eaa2dd34a3520b714208:index.html | sha256sum

